@startuml
title Resource Order Item (User Equipment) Processing

participant "Product Order\nDelivery & Orchestration\nManagement" as PODOM
participant "Event Management" as Event #grey

box "Logistic Partner"
  participant "Supply Chain\nManagement" as SCM #blue
end box

box "Internal Supply Chain"
  participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue
  participant "Resource Inventory" as RI #blue
  participant "Resource Catalog\nManagement" as RCM #blue
end box

== Step 1 (User Equipment) ==

ROM -> RCM : 1 **TMF634 Resource Catalog Management**\nGET /resourceSpecification
activate RCM
RCM --> ROM : 2 **TMF634** 200 OK (ResourceSpecChar)
deactivate RCM

ROM -> RI : 3 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nGET /resource
activate RI
RI --> ROM : 4 **TMF639** 200 OK (User Equipment, IMEI,EID,SKU)
deactivate RI

ROM -> Event : 5 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event resourceOrderAttributeValueChange\n(User Equipment)
activate Event
Event -> PODOM : 6 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/resourceOrderAttributeValueChange\n(User Equipment)
deactivate Event

ROM -> SCM : 7 **TMF700 Shipping Order Management**\n//POST /shippingOrder// (User Equipment)
activate SCM
SCM --> ROM : 8 //**TMF700** 201 Created (shippingOrder)//

note over SCM, ROM
  Actual shipment process is not shown.
  UC004 has some details.
end note

SCM -> Event : 9 //**TMF688 Event Management**//\n//POST event shippingOrderStateChange//
activate Event
Event -> ROM : 10 //**TMF688 Event Management**//\n//POST listener/shippingOrderStateChange//
deactivate Event
deactivate SCM

ROM -> RI : 11 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource (User Equipment, resourceStatus="standby")
activate RI
RI --> ROM : 12 **TMF639** 204 No Content
deactivate RI

ROM -> ROM : 13 update resourceOrder (state="completed")

note over ROM : continued in\nfigure 10

@enduml
